---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Icon from "../components/Icon.astro";
import { siteContent } from "../content/site";
import { getContactConfig } from "../lib/contact-config.ts";
import { siteConfig } from "../lib/site-config";

// The notice describes what this build actually does, not what a different deployment might do.
const delivery = getContactConfig({
  SITE_MODE: process.env.SITE_MODE ?? import.meta.env.SITE_MODE,
  PUBLIC_SITE_URL: process.env.PUBLIC_SITE_URL ?? import.meta.env.PUBLIC_SITE_URL,
  PUBLIC_CONTACT_EMAIL: process.env.PUBLIC_CONTACT_EMAIL ?? import.meta.env.PUBLIC_CONTACT_EMAIL,
  RESEND_API_KEY: process.env.RESEND_API_KEY ?? import.meta.env.RESEND_API_KEY,
  CONTACT_FROM_EMAIL: process.env.CONTACT_FROM_EMAIL ?? import.meta.env.CONTACT_FROM_EMAIL,
  CONTACT_TO_EMAIL: process.env.CONTACT_TO_EMAIL ?? import.meta.env.CONTACT_TO_EMAIL,
  CONTACT_RATE_LIMIT_CONFIGURED: process.env.CONTACT_RATE_LIMIT_CONFIGURED ?? import.meta.env.CONTACT_RATE_LIMIT_CONFIGURED,
});
---

<BaseLayout isHome={false} mainLabelledBy="privacy-heading">
  <article class="privacy-page container">
    <a href="/" class="text-link privacy-back"><Icon name="arrow" size={17} />Back to the website</a>
    <h1 id="privacy-heading">Privacy, in plain language.</h1>
    <p class="privacy-lead">This notice covers the <span class="wordmark">JB Automate</span> website and its enquiry form, not the separate data arrangements for client projects.</p>
    <section><h2>What the enquiry form collects</h2><p>Your name, email address, optional business name, and the message you choose to send. Please provide only a high-level description. Do not submit confidential business information, protected datasets, or personal records.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Why we use it</h2><p>We use enquiry details to understand the request, respond, and arrange a conversation about a potential engagement. The form does not subscribe you to marketing emails.</p></section>
    {delivery.available ? (
      <section><h2>Where it goes</h2><p>The website processes the form request and Resend delivers the enquiry to our business mailbox. These providers and the receiving mailbox provider may process personal information and retain operational or delivery records.</p><p>We also keep a copy of each enquiry in our own database so a request is not lost if email delivery fails, and so we can follow it up. That copy holds what you typed in the form, the time it arrived, whether the email was accepted, and two one-way hashes used only to stop repeated automated submissions. We do not store your address in a readable form, and there is no customer account or login on this site.</p></section>
    ) : (
      <section><h2>Where it goes</h2><p>This website does not transmit the form for you. When you press send, your own email application opens with the details already written out, and the message reaches us only if you send it yourself. Nothing you type into the form is uploaded to this site, and the site keeps no database of enquiries.</p><p>The message then sits in our business mailbox, and that mailbox provider processes and retains it under its own arrangements. Our hosting provider serves these pages and may record technical information such as your network address and browser in order to deliver and protect the service.</p></section>
    )}
    <section><h2>Retention and deletion</h2><p>{siteContent.privacy.retention}</p></section>
    <section><h2>Advertising measurement, cookies, and fonts</h2>{siteConfig.ads.enabled ? <><p>With your permission, the site loads Google Ads measurement. Google may use cookies or similar identifiers to connect an ad interaction with a website enquiry. If you submit the form after allowing measurement, your email address may be normalized and securely hashed before it is sent to Google for enhanced conversion measurement.</p><p>You can decline advertising measurement when prompted. Declining does not prevent you from using the website or sending an enquiry. Your choice is stored in your browser, and advertising attribution is kept only for the current browser session.</p></> : <p>The site does not currently load analytics or advertising measurement. If advertising measurement is enabled, this notice and the on-site consent choice will describe it before identifiers are stored or sent.</p>}<p>Fonts and visual assets are served with the website. Hosting and form-delivery providers may collect technical information needed to operate and protect their services.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Security and client projects</h2><p>The public enquiry form is not a channel for protected business data. Project-specific access controls, processing arrangements, provider choices, and support responsibilities are discussed separately before sensitive information is used.</p><p>We limit information requested by the form and use appropriate transport and submission protections, but do not promise that any internet service is free from risk.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Questions about your information</h2><p>Contact <span class="wordmark">JB Automate</span> using <a href={siteConfig.emailHref}>{siteConfig.email}</a> to ask about an enquiry or request deletion. We will explain any applicable limitations.</p></section>
    <a href="/#contact" class="button button--primary">Back to the conversation<Icon name="diagonal" size={17} /></a>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
